s. The results have been amazing across the board - these clients are seeing real growth, and I’m finally able to deliver that deep, strategic SEO work without the manual grind.\nNow we’re ready to scale this across our entire portfolio of 200 clients - specifically for those who want to take their SEO game to the next level. Because we’ve proven it works, both for ourselves and our initial clients."])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"34:{\"src\":\"/_next/static/media/logo.0b735602.svg\",\"height\":32,\"width\":109,\"blurWidth\":0,\"blurHeight\":0}\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"11:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"__variable_c70c06 __variable_6ea4a9 __variable_b9c7ce __variable_3ed91a\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"landing-page\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative flex flex-col min-h-screen bg-white overflow-x-hidden\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute hidden lg:block pointer-events-none left-0 top-0  \",\"src\":{\"src\":\"/_next/static/media/price-blur-left.708da32a.png\",\"height\":861,\"width\":391,\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAQAAAAICAMAAADp7a43AAAABlBMVEVzDP9/G//ovSYqAAAAAnRSTlMCD9QasisAAAAJcEhZcwAACxMAAAsTAQCanBgAAAAWSURBVHicY2AAAUYEASKRCLA0AwMDAADfAAoc7rWNAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\",\"blurWidth\":4,\"blurHeight\":8},\"alt\":\"decorative blur\",\"width\":500,\"height\":500}],[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute hidden lg:block pointer-events-none right-0 top-0  \",\"src\":{\"src\":\"/_next/static/media/price-plur-right.1be0e8aa.png\",\"height\":861,\"width\":510,\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAUAAAAICAMAAAAGL8UJAAAABlBMVEVaBP99Iv/1bmDBAAAAAnRSTlMCD9QasisAAAAJcEhZcwAACxMAAAsTAQCanBgAAAAVSURBVHicY2CAAUZGOMmIxIaSMAAAAUoADDonKeMAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\",\"blurWidth\":5,\"blurHeight\":8},\"alt\":\"decorative blur\",\"width\":500,\"height\":500}]],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"z-50 sticky top-3\",\"ch